    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75466" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρφο-βότης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρφανοτρόφος</span>
			, and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρφο-βοτία</span></b> ,
				ἡ, <i>the care</i> or <i>education
				of orphans,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, who also cites <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὤρφωσεν</span>
			(fr. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρφόω</span></b> ) for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠρφάνισεν.</span></div>
